  "remarks": "Maxim Vakstein is the General Director of the Foundation for Advanced Studies. The Foundation for Advanced Studies was established by the Government of the Russian Federation to promote and fund research and development of weapons and equipment to support the Russian Armed Forces and the military production sector. The Foundation for Advanced Studies has funded several projects to develop advanced unmanned systems for military purposes.",
